# 🚀 Overview

VERIQ (Verify Before You Trust) is an AI-powered Digital Decision Intelligence Platform that helps users verify suspicious digital interactions before taking action.

Modern cyberattacks no longer target systems alone—they manipulate human trust through phishing, fake bank messages, digital arrest scams, QR fraud, AI-generated voices, investment scams, and cryptocurrency attacks.

VERIQ combines Artificial Intelligence, OCR, Voice AI, and Automation to investigate suspicious messages, websites, payment requests, screenshots, and voice conversations. Instead of simply identifying scams, VERIQ explains why an interaction is risky, predicts possible consequences, and provides personalized safety guidance.

