# 🎙️ VERA

VERA (VERIQ Emergency Response Assistant) is an AI voice assistant powered by ElevenLabs.

VERA helps users by:

- Understanding suspicious situations
- Asking intelligent follow-up questions
- Explaining cyber threats
- Recommending safe actions
- Generating investigation summaries


